Package: libappmenu-glib-translator0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: translator from the DBusMenu protocol to GMenuModel
 This library imports a menu exported over the com.canonical.dbusmenu
 interface and presents it as a GMenuModel, so that a GTK application can
 render a remote application menu.
 .
 Both Debian and Ubuntu link this library statically into the vala-panel
 appmenu applet and expose no part of it, so it is built here instead.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libappmenu-glib-translator-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Provides: ${gir:Provides}
Depends:
 libappmenu-glib-translator0 (= ${binary:Version}),
 gir1.2-appmenuglibtranslator-24.02 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libglib2.0-dev,
 libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-dev,
 ${gir:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: translator from the DBusMenu protocol to GMenuModel (development files)
 This library imports a menu exported over the com.canonical.dbusmenu
 interface and presents it as a GMenuModel.
 .
 The pkg-config file names gio-unix-2.0 and gdk-pixbuf-2.0 in Requires, so
 both of their development packages are dependencies here.
 .
 This package contains the headers, the pkg-config file, the GIR XML and the
 Vala bindings.

Package: gir1.2-appmenuglibtranslator-24.02
Section: introspection
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libappmenu-glib-translator0 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${gir:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: GObject introspection data for the DBusMenu to GMenuModel translator
 This library imports a menu exported over the com.canonical.dbusmenu
 interface and presents it as a GMenuModel.
 .
 This package contains the introspection typelib, for language bindings that
 load it at run time.
